# ToneJS

Apply safety measures on sound output volume to prevent damage to speakers or ears.

## Audio Management

All ToneJS oscillators and instruments must be started and stopped in the audio callbacks when using the audio switch:

```typescript
const { app, audioSwitch } = await utils.createApp({
  audio: {
    start: () => {
      oscillator.start();
      synth.start();
      // Start all audio elements here
    },
    stop: () => {
      oscillator.stop();
      synth.stop();
      // Stop all audio elements here
    },
  },
});
```

This ensures proper audio context management and prevents audio from playing without user interaction.

